      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start but i think it's a bit too brief. the board is really looking for a sense of \"granularity\" and they like seeing a lot of distinct items broken down so it looks like we're being extremely meticulous with our oversight. \n\ncan you expand this? try to break down the findings into more specific sub-points or individual observations so the summary feels more exhaustive. like, instead of one bullet for KYC, maybe several bullets detailing the different aspects of the KYC failures. just please make sure they actually mean something—I really don't want a bunch of filler or fluff, I just need the summary to feel much more detailed and \"heavy\" using more bulleted points.",
